### ====================================================================
### HESTA Smart Home - Sliding Gate IoT & MQTT Test Suite
### ====================================================================
### Cấu hình thiết bị theo ESP32-CAM AI-Thinker:
### - Node ID:   32442d7f-dfcf-4b2f-a380-adba32876cec (LED_Normal Hub)
### - Device ID: 2d566d0a-f7d6-4fac-a0bf-18912da4ab28
### - Topics:
###   + Command:   hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
###   + State:     hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/state
###   + Telemetry: hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId = 2d566d0a-f7d6-4fac-a0bf-18912da4ab28
@nodeId = 32442d7f-dfcf-4b2f-a380-adba32876cec
#@token = 

### ====================================================================
### 0. (Optional) Login to obtain JWT Bearer token if authentication is enabled
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "123123123"
}

> {%
    if (response.body && response.body.result && response.body.result.accessToken) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.result.accessToken);
    }
%}

### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 1: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỔNG QUA CHUYÊN BIỆT GATE CONTROLLER API
### Endpoint Base: /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/...
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Lệnh MỞ CỔNG (OPEN) qua shortcut endpoint (kèm ?nodeId={{nodeId}} nếu cần)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/open?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 Lệnh ĐÓNG CỔNG (CLOSE) qua shortcut endpoint (kèm ?nodeId={{nodeId}} nếu cần)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/close?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.3 Lệnh DỪNG CỔNG (STOP) qua shortcut endpoint (kèm ?nodeId={{nodeId}} nếu cần)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/stop?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.4 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: OPEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 1.5 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: CLOSE kèm chỉ định Node ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 1.6 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: STOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 1.7 Lấy trạng thái hiện tại của cổng (State, Limit Switch Open/Close)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/state
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 2: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỔNG QUA GENERIC DEVICE COMMAND API
### Endpoint Base: POST /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Generic Command - OPEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 2.2 Generic Command - CLOSE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 2.3 Generic Command - STOP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 2.4 Generic Command - Mở kèm thời gian chỉ định (duration = 3500ms)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN",
  "duration": 3500
}

### 2.5 Generic Command - Mở kèm số vòng quay chỉ định (turns = 6 vòng)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN",
  "turns": 6
}

### 2.6 Cài đặt thời gian hành trình mặc định (Lưu Flash NVS) - 5000ms
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_DURATION",
  "duration": 5000
}

### 2.7 Cài đặt số vòng quay hành trình mặc định (Lưu Flash NVS) - 10 vòng
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_TURNS",
  "turns": 10
}

### 2.8 Cài đặt tốc độ motor PWM (0 - 255)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_SPEED",
  "speed": 230
}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 3: KIỂM TRA THÔNG TIN THIẾT BỊ VÀ LỊCH SỬ TRẠNG THÁI (NẾU ĐÃ LƯU DB)
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 Xem chi tiết thiết bị
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Xem lịch sử thay đổi trạng thái (OPEN, CLOSING, STOPPED,...)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 4: KIỂM TRA VALIDATION VÀ XỬ LÝ LỖI (EXPECTED 400 BAD REQUEST)
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Lỗi: Action không hợp lệ (Ví dụ: "FLY" -> Expected HTTP 400 GATE_ACTION_INVALID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "FLY"
}

### 4.2 Lỗi: Action bị bỏ trống (Expected HTTP 400 INVALID_DEVICE_ACTION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": ""
}
